% Mesh points with fixed curvilinear velocities (HYDRO_FIX_MESH_MOTION=2/3) in a cold, static, non-periodic ball of gas.
% The test sets HYDRO_FIX_MESH_MOTION and writes the ICs (with ParticleVelocities) itself.
InitCondFile                       mesh_motion_curvilinear_ics
OutputDir                          output
TimeBegin                          0
TimeMax                            0.5
TimeOfFirstSnapshot                0
BoxSize                            4
TimeBetSnapshot                    0.25
MaxSizeTimestep                    0.01
DesNumNgb                          32
MaxNumNgbDeviation                 0.1
CourantFac                         0.2
ErrTolIntAccuracy                  0.01
MaxRMSDisplacementFac              0.125
ErrTolForceAcc                     0.001
ErrTolTheta                        0.7
TimeBetStatistics                  0.5
MaxMemSize                         1000
ResubmitOn                         0
ResubmitCommand                    none
